# FinTrack environment variables
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit real values.
#
# Both values are PUBLIC by design (they ship to the browser). Data access is
# protected by Postgres Row Level Security, not by hiding these keys.
# NEVER put the Supabase service_role key in any VITE_* variable.

# Supabase project URL — Project Settings → API (or `npx supabase status` locally)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=

# Supabase anon / publishable key — Project Settings → API
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Leave both empty to run FinTrack in browser-only demo mode (no account, data in localStorage).
